  "question": {
    "text": "Select the set having incorrect statements given here.<br />\r(i) Manganese exhibits +7 oxidation state<br />\r(ii) Zinc forms coloured ions<br />\r(iii) <math><mo>[</mo><mtext>Co</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> is diamagnetic<br />\r(iv) Sc forms +4 oxidation state<br />\r(v) Zn exhibits only +2 oxidation state",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ND28Z",
      "text": "(i), (ii) and (iii)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HwNOC",
      "text": "(ii), (iii) and (iv)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
